## What I Learned

### Building and Shipping Are Different

Developing features is only one part of software engineering. Delivering a usable product requires deployment, verification, testing, and refinement.

### End-to-End Testing Matters

Testing the entire workflow helps identify issues that isolated feature testing often misses.

### MVP First, Perfection Later

Launching a functional MVP provides real value and creates a solid foundation for future improvements.

